@startuml GetEnterpriseDetailSequenceDiagram

actor "前端客户端" as Client
participant "CreditDualFormController" as Controller
participant "CreditDualFormServiceImpl" as Service
participant "IEvalUnionService" as UnionService
participant "IEvalBidderExtendService" as ExtendService
participant "JSON处理" as JSON

Client -> Controller: POST /getEnterpriseDetail\n(GetEnterpriseDetailDTO)
Controller -> Service: getEnterpriseDetail(dto)

alt 是联合体成员
    Service -> UnionService: 查询联合体扩展信息
    UnionService --> Service: List<EvalUnion>

    loop 遍历联合体条目
        Service -> JSON: 解析extJson
        JSON --> Service: creditDualForm数组

        loop 查找匹配的uniqueId
            Service -> Service: 提取企业详细信息
        end
    end
else 不是联合体成员
    Service -> ExtendService: 查询投标单位扩展信息
    ExtendService --> Service: EvalBidderExtend

    Service -> JSON: 解析evalJson
    JSON --> Service: creditDualForm数组

    loop 查找匹配的uniqueId
        Service -> Service: 提取企业详细信息
    end
end

Service --> Controller: EnterpriseDetailVO
Controller --> Client: Result<EnterpriseDetailVO>

@enduml